dict-jargon for Debian
----------------------

The Jargon File includes three sections: Introduction, The Jargon 
Lexicon, and Appendices.

Just 'The Jargon Lexicon' is included in the Debian dict-jargon package. 
The references to the Crunchly saga cartoons has been deleted as the 
cartoons are not included. No other changes to this section have been made,
except for formatting.

If you are interested on other sections, see the jargon-text package.

The source was extracted from: http://catb.org/jargon/jargsrc.tar.gz

 -- Ruben Molina <rmolina@udea.edu.co>, Tue, 13 Jan 2009 22:51:03 -0500
